Subject: [PATCH 0020] Texture override hook for game profiles

A game profile may draw its own image for some textures, ahead of the
texture pack and of the upscaler, and is shown the pack's image for the
texture to paint over (VC2: the button prompt atlas redrawn for the device
in use). When the profile's images change it bumps a generation and the
textures it claimed are made again. gpu::set_texture_override(),
gpu::bump_texture_override_generation(), TexturePack::decode_now().

